# Line endings: on machines with core.autocrlf=true (e.g. Windows) a checkout would
# rewrite these files with CRLF, which breaks `build.sh` on macOS (bad interpreter)
# and rewrites Info.plist — a file hashed by codesign — invalidating the bundle's signature.
# 行尾保护：core.autocrlf=true 时检出会转成 CRLF，将使 build.sh 在 macOS 上无法执行，并破坏 App 签名。
*.sh            text eol=lf
*.swift         text eol=lf
*.md            text eol=lf

# 构建产物按二进制处理，字节保持原样
*.plist         -text
CodeResources   -text
*.icns          binary
*.png           binary
MouseHighlighter binary
